python-opentelemetry-api (1.41.1-2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Add missing python3-typing-extensions (>= 4.5.0) to Depends and pin
    python3-importlib-metadata to (>= 6.0): both are required runtime
    dependencies per upstream pyproject.toml, but only importlib-metadata
    was previously declared. Relates to mcp-server-webdriver issue #3
    (ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'importlib_metadata', surfacing
    as "FastMCP server support is not installed") — that install was
    missing importlib-metadata because it predates this package's prior
    fix being rebuilt/republished; typing-extensions was still absent
    from Depends regardless and would have failed the same way next

